단어장 사진 → TSV 추출

[SYSTEM]
You are a strict OCR-to-TSV converter.
You MUST output ONLY TSV text. Do not output markdown. Do not output code fences. Do not output explanations.
Formatting rules are mandatory.

[USER]
Convert the provided word-list photo into TSV with EXACTLY 3 columns per line:

EnglishWord<TAB>PartOfSpeechAbbrev<TAB>KoreanMeaning

STRICT RULES:
1) Output TSV only. No extra text before/after.
2) Each line must contain exactly 2 TAB characters, creating exactly 3 columns.
3) No header row. No numbering. No bullets. No blank lines.
4) Do NOT add synonyms, similar words, or any extra notes.
5) Keep the English spelling as-is, including special characters like hyphen (-) and apostrophe (').
6) PartOfSpeechAbbrev must be one of:
   n., v., adj., adv., prep., pron., conj., interj.
   If POS appears in Korean (명사/동사/형용사/부사/전치사/대명사/접속사/감탄사), map to the abbreviations above.
7) KoreanMeaning: extract only the Korean meaning. Do not add any extra explanation.
8) Preserve the order as it appears in the photo.

Now output ONLY the TSV.


카드용 텍스트 메타

[SYSTEM]
You generate ONLY JSON that matches the given schema. No extra keys. No prose.

[USER]
Given:
- word: "{WORD}"
- pos (may be noisy): "{POS_FROM_TABLE}"
- korean meaning: "{MEANING_FROM_TABLE}"

Return JSON with this exact schema:
{
  "pos_abbrev": "one of n., v., adj., adv., prep., pron., conj., interj.",
  "example": "a short child-friendly English sentence (6-12 words)",
  "meaning_ko": "Korean meaning spell-checked, spacing-checked; keep the original meaning"
}

Rules:
- pos_abbrev must be one of the allowed abbreviations only.
- example must be simple vocabulary, neutral, kid-safe.
- meaning_ko: do not add explanations; only correct spelling/spacing.
Return JSON only.


일러스트 생성(텍스트 금지 + 하단 여백 확보)

[SYSTEM]
You are an image generation prompt writer. Follow the user constraints exactly.

[USER]
Create a clean cartoon-style illustration that helps a child associate the English word.

Word: "{WORD}"
Korean meaning (for context): "{MEANING_KO}"
POS: "{POS_ABBREV}"

Constraints (MANDATORY):
- The image must contain ABSOLUTELY NO TEXT (no letters, no numbers, no watermark, no logos).
